 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "In nineteen thirty-two,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 1.424
  },
  {
   "text": "the Australian army went to war...",
   "s": 1.672,
   "e": 3.437
  },
  {
   "text": "against birds.",
   "s": 3.968,
   "e": 5.07
  },
  {
   "text": "Out in Western Australia,",
   "s": 5.648,
   "e": 6.883
  },
  {
   "text": "twenty thousand emus march onto the farms,",
   "s": 7.109,
   "e": 9.971
  },
  {
   "text": "and eat all the wheat.",
   "s": 10.123,
   "e": 11.149
  },
  {
   "text": "The farmers beg for help.",
   "s": 11.661,
   "e": 12.964
  },
  {
   "text": "So the army sends a major,",
   "s": 13.566,
   "e": 15.212
  },
  {
   "text": "two soldiers,",
   "s": 15.444,
   "e": 16.182
  },
  {
   "text": "and two machine guns.",
   "s": 16.337,
   "e": 17.468
  },
  {
   "text": "Everyone laughs.",
   "s": 17.961,
   "e": 18.985
  },
  {
   "text": "Machine guns?",
   "s": 19.231,
   "e": 20.149
  },
  {
   "text": "Against giant chickens?",
   "s": 20.47,
   "e": 21.876
  },
  {
   "text": "But the emus have a plan.",
   "s": 22.467,
   "e": 23.852
  },
  {
   "text": "They split into tiny groups, and scatter.",
   "s": 24.319,
   "e": 26.539
  },
  {
   "text": "The soldiers chase them in a truck.",
   "s": 27.107,
   "e": 28.709
  },
  {
   "text": "The emus run fifty kilometres an hour, straight through the bushes.",
   "s": 29.184,
   "e": 32.567
  },
  {
   "text": "The truck can't keep up.",
   "s": 32.97,
   "e": 33.973
  },
  {
   "text": "So they set an ambush at a dam.",
   "s": 34.578,
   "e": 36.423
  },
  {
   "text": "A thousand emus walk right into it.",
   "s": 36.971,
   "e": 39.208
  },
  {
   "text": "The gunner opens fire,",
   "s": 39.707,
   "e": 40.88
  },
  {
   "text": "and the gun jams.",
   "s": 41.282,
   "e": 42.433
  },
  {
   "text": "After a month,",
   "s": 43.032,
   "e": 43.817
  },
  {
   "text": "the army has fired ten thousand bullets.",
   "s": 44.032,
   "e": 46.514
  },
  {
   "text": "About ten bullets for every bird they hit.",
   "s": 46.892,
   "e": 49.058
  },
  {
   "text": "You see,",
   "s": 49.593,
   "e": 49.974
  },
  {
   "text": "an emu is fast,",
   "s": 50.174,
   "e": 51.426
  },
  {
   "text": "tough,",
   "s": 51.685,
   "e": 52.045
  },
  {
   "text": "and it never stays in one big crowd.",
   "s": 52.324,
   "e": 54.231
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the crazy part.",
   "s": 54.755,
   "e": 55.965
  },
  {
   "text": "The major said,",
   "s": 56.44,
   "e": 57.18
  },
  {
   "text": "if he had soldiers who could take bullets like those birds,",
   "s": 57.356,
   "e": 60.118
  },
  {
   "text": "he could beat any army in the world.",
   "s": 60.409,
   "e": 62.57
  },
  {
   "text": "The army went home.",
   "s": 63.196,
   "e": 64.027
  },
  {
   "text": "The emus won.",
   "s": 64.576,
   "e": 65.582
  }
 ]
}